flowchart LR
  subgraph S[Single Agent]
    A[一个 Agent 持有状态] --> M[Metrics Tool]
    A --> L[Logs Tool]
    A --> T[Topology Tool]
    M --> U[共同状态]
    L --> U
    T --> U
    U --> A
  end
  subgraph X[Multi-Agent]
    C[Coordinator] --> MA[Metric Agent]
    C --> LA[Log Agent]
    C --> TA[Topology Agent]
    MA --> E[带来源的 Evidence Tickets]
    LA --> E
    TA --> E
    E --> R[RCA Agent]
    R --> V[Verifier：fresh query / rule check]
    V --> D{满足停止条件？}
    D -->|是| F[结束]
    D -->|否| C
  end
